  <History Date="03-08-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" Version="0" />
  <History Date="03-08-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="(note control channel appears to have options to change DMX mode.  dynamic modes are not currently supported.  amongst other things the console would need to know the current fixture mode which is not possible and even if it was changing mode would affect footprint potentially causing conflicts)" Version="0" />
